# Consent UI copy for {{PRODUCT_NAME}}

## 1. Cookie banner (only if non-essential storage exists)

**Title:** Your privacy choices

**Body:**
We use cookies that are needed to make {{PRODUCT_NAME}} work. With your permission we would also like to use {{OPTIONAL_CATEGORIES}} cookies to {{OPTIONAL_PURPOSES_SHORT}}. You can change your mind at any time. [Cookie Policy]({{COOKIE_POLICY_URL}})

**Buttons (same size, same style, same row):**

| Label | Action |
|---|---|
| Accept all | Turns on every optional category |
| Reject all | Turns off every optional category |
| Choose | Opens the settings panel below |

**Settings panel:**
- Strictly necessary: always on. {{NECESSARY_DESCRIPTION}}
{{#has_functional}}- [ ] Functional: {{FUNCTIONAL_DESCRIPTION}}{{/has_functional}}
{{#has_analytics}}- [ ] Analytics: {{ANALYTICS_DESCRIPTION}}{{/has_analytics}}
{{#has_advertising}}- [ ] Advertising: {{ADVERTISING_DESCRIPTION}}{{/has_advertising}}
- Buttons: **Save my choices**, **Accept all**, **Reject all** (equal prominence).

**After the choice:** a persistent link "{{COOKIE_SETTINGS_LABEL}}" in the footer reopens this panel.

## 2. Signup consent

Required (terms and privacy):
- [ ] I have read and agree to the [Terms of Service]({{TOS_URL}}) and have read the [Privacy Policy]({{PRIVACY_URL}}).

> This box covers the terms only. It must not mention marketing.

Optional items, each its own unticked box, none required to sign up:
{{#sends_marketing}}- [ ] Send me {{MARKETING_DESCRIPTION}} by {{MARKETING_CHANNEL}}. I can unsubscribe at any time.{{/sends_marketing}}
{{#optional_data_sharing}}- [ ] {{OPTIONAL_PROCESSING_DESCRIPTION}}{{/optional_data_sharing}}
{{#ai_features}}- [ ] {{AI_OPTIONAL_CONSENT_TEXT}} (see [AI Disclosure]({{AI_DISCLOSURE_URL}})){{/ai_features}}

Button: **Create account**. It works with the optional boxes left empty.

